## Shared contact plan for the admin-record source-authentication test.
## Chain topology 1 <-> 2 <-> 3: node 1 and node 3 are NOT contact-plan
## neighbors of each other, so a status signal that node 3 addresses to
## node 1 arrives from a source that node 1 does not otherwise recognize.
m horizon +0
a range +0 +600 1 2 1
a range +0 +600 2 1 1
a range +0 +600 2 3 1
a range +0 +600 3 2 1
a contact +0 +600 1 2 100000
a contact +0 +600 2 1 100000
a contact +0 +600 2 3 100000
a contact +0 +600 3 2 100000
